% 0 1 0 1d5c255c1a672f160d4a2bc857ae144e

% 0 1 0 170b1ee9deac31d91592f8365e79c66d

% 1 1 0 1de3d174edb6491f08a932fc6d6ec487

@ 0 1 0 0be2d774d4504b1817dedb2c1576b32c
+ `keep` prende anche un predicato, e conserva i caratteri che lo soddisfano:

